# Density Compare
# Bismuth (Bi) — real density 9.78 g/cm³. equal masses: Bismuth vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Bismuth Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 9.3mm color: #9c7ac7 at (-20mm, 4.7mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 78.0 g — the water cube is the reference
